    "proof_core": "For a tail period of length p and valuation sum A, global coefficient safety forces A/p<log2(3) (strict because log2(3) is irrational). The period map has fixed point C/(2^A-3^p), with C>0 and denominator<0. Inverse accelerated steps x=(2^a*y-1)/3 preserve negativity.",
